{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "86211363ff36fef8b3c5b8a2a802512cdf77fd53133d1ad3d720cb8fed47eab0", "ja": "バックヤードにて", "zh": "后台处", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1176194b26ce9ec746ba9bb2a6f04c9ebe7b1a2f3d988a5ed369e6b87b37af42", "ja": "朋花と打ち合わせをしているプロデューサー\nの元に、可憐がやって来る。相談に来たと言\nうが、朋花が何か悩んでいることに気づく。\n反射的に警戒する朋花に、可憐は真っ直ぐな\n気持ちを語り、心を通わせる二人。", "zh": "制作人正与朋花开会，可憐来访。她说是来咨询的，却察觉到朋花似乎有什么烦恼。面对本能地戒备起来的朋花，可憐坦诚地说出心里话，两人的心意由此相通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6641d050e6c4e7b43253ca6ce4430a43cb5a3121c582af63ee5e8284127196ed", "ja": "（今日は、朋花と打ち合わせ。次の撮影は\nアイテムを決めるため、早めに来てもらう事にした）", "zh": "（今天要和朋花开会。为了决定下次拍摄要用的道具，请她早点过来了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "a7cfc015f5c110045531d397d584211cd71c02961cf99e2d0d72417ce1694c97", "ja": "では、当日はよろしくお願いしますね～。", "zh": "那么，当天就拜托您了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5eb3fe909c315126f2f017b948e0ee03172e56f5024381282c7c307d24cc4236", "ja": "うん。……で、アイテムの方はどうだ？\n何か、決められそうか？", "zh": "嗯。……那么，道具那边怎么样了？\n有决定好用什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "6698006d51303c2ee664fcd9728ac8d79c688b7b21e2511f4f3ffdc924f33bbc", "ja": "……そうですね～、もちろん、\nやれるだけのことはやるつもりですよ～。", "zh": "……是啊～当然，\n我打算尽我所能去做～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f19199515ca7aaca405103603521d4c8a7681a25da64228e3ffa9b7b524ec868", "ja": "（うーん……言葉に勢いがないな。\nこれは、思ったより根が深いかもしれない……）", "zh": "（嗯……话语里没什么干劲啊。这问题可能比想象中还要根深蒂固……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1005_se", "source_sha256": "b437ffc0d45172b7b137b77fb8c6233537dead82c70400771fce1ce09a8be304", "ja": "コンコン……ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚……咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "203c6200491267dcc7bc2abe25174fc995f1c5491d164e28dda18cbc75685159", "ja": "し、失礼します……{$P$}さん。\n……あ、朋花ちゃん……。", "zh": "失、失礼了……{$P$}先生。\n……啊，朋花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "63530b171a75a1de78e8d9ba5e2ffb56f03073135a7f6420437c9fbadb736dfd", "ja": "あれ、可憐？　お疲れ様。", "zh": "咦，可怜？辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "5c699e1b2a8eb4737a50b794bb686917f72b6e898e94ad62fc42507c2dafedf7", "ja": "お疲れさまです～。\n可憐さんも、スケジュールの調整に来たんですか～？", "zh": "辛苦了～。\n可怜也是来调整日程的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "707163bc3d903539eb98fbc77ffb7c845a97dd076102957a8346547f1990e1ce", "ja": "ううん、私は、ち、ちょっと相談に……。\nあ、邪魔しちゃったかな？　だったらごめんね……！", "zh": "不是的，我、我只是来商量一点事情……\n啊，是不是打扰到你了？那就对不起啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "58b265c5e631a3c9a74a765071612d265875c314776cc3b9af970e68d458bdcc", "ja": "いいえ～、私の用事は終わりました～。\nもう帰るので、大丈夫ですよ～。それでは……。", "zh": "没有的事～，我的事情已经办完了～。\n我这就回去了，没关系的～。那就先失陪了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "30b6da676d071b230f0b9f8d4564c1feef64d2ef52bb215850aca42c1f526087", "ja": "あ、朋花……！", "zh": "啊，朋花……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "622c144c97123f1285f0a8ee8d3019a7108402baa85e0229015fb2390b13a290", "ja": "あ、あの、朋花ちゃん！　あ、あのね……\nもしかして、なにか、その……悩んでたり、する？", "zh": "啊，那个，朋花！那个……  \n你该不会，是在为什么事情……烦恼吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "28b0b1c698ddf6c960326cd8e6ae812dbe3c4fe44ff76c026cc9381bf35b61a6", "ja": "……？\nなぜ、そう思うんですか～？", "zh": "……？\n为什么会这么想呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "9054c93b702589a9481faddee8f47f741345512641f1f8f3c1112216f2bc7dc2", "ja": "あ……ご、ごめんね。\nただなんとなく、そうかなって……。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起。\n只是隐约觉得……可能是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "de8093cc8f917e3e6002223d8fec510656e7a004e35e96f42afd74e65b943ef3", "ja": "で、でも……悩んでるんだったら、\nやっぱり朋花ちゃんは凄いなぁって、思う。", "zh": "可、可是……如果你正在烦恼的话，\n我还是觉得，朋花真厉害啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "d68231fa12ddb4cd2efc2b365439eb16575a670e62bfc2b3bb75cbd0fd564b31", "ja": "すごい……？", "zh": "很厉害……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "fbfae100e750aee30a2851a4560aedd9b8bce5f6ba9e7f0f78b5cc85d45fe782", "ja": "うん……な、悩んでるってことは、今のままじゃなく、\nもっと先に行こうとしているってことだもん……。", "zh": "嗯……既、既然你在烦恼，就说明你不想停留在现在，而是想走得更远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "971bf19ad890be7f729c423ab04360ed4b3c84d7f78cc0f53fe59f900ff4bd09", "ja": "わ、私なんて、ただ勇気が出せなくって……。\nウジウジしてるだけで、悩みにもなってないから……。", "zh": "我、我只是拿不出勇气……\n只是在畏畏缩缩的，根本连烦恼都算不上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "e6adc3b5fec42b4b9e956d2962a0f7dc25192f83632dd9226e1403a2cc7b28fd", "ja": "私が、そんな風にしてる間にも……朋花ちゃんは、\nずっと先に行っちゃうんだなぁ、って……。", "zh": "就在我还这样犹豫不决的时候……朋花她，\n已经走在我前面很远了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "315bc25f03713ce5cfceec5a66000b1b0114b0142f25676eb79e5b050f85a9e4", "ja": "……そんなことは。", "zh": "……才没有那种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "75f152aaff6c4b550b819cabc34e7f20d0e3f27cb00d4c30d8274df315a45852", "ja": "でも、だから……わ、私も、\n頑張らなくちゃって思うんだ……！", "zh": "可是，所以……我、我也觉得……必须努力才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "b7237cdac82ca35aa88937adf1bfca5b86def6f9408979b7f2500c49dfb7d33d", "ja": "お、置いて行かれたくないから……。\n朋花ちゃんたちに勝てるか、わからないけど。", "zh": "我、我不想被丢下……虽然不知道能不能赢过朋花她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "7ff2d2332dec6921a1c28e132b77d25430fa03c906ad2f2f9e6f930b43922b7a", "ja": "でも、せめて……朋花ちゃんに恥ずかしくないくらい、\n私も……ミラス・ミランのモデル、が、頑張るね……！", "zh": "但是，至少……我也会努力……努力到不会让朋花丢脸的程度，成为米拉斯·米兰的模特……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "998e61c97b5da0fb5815f4b57806983fc6db776dca8eb6ad1681de7f87b3d760", "ja": "い、言っちゃったから……\nやるしか、なくなっちゃった……てへへ♪", "zh": "既、既然都说出口了……就只能做下去了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "f754b1c1e8cdfd3ed78d9569480fdf37710e3aec261ecd1149f2eff6e28ccec9", "ja": "……私は別に、何も言っていませんが～。", "zh": "……我又没说什么呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "be6bf75120c3d72e46f5c8b09ef9bc72b4d4a23362c89207262981bfb0244d07", "ja": "そ、そうだよね……！　でも、別々のブランドで\nお仕事してたから、顔が見られて、嬉しくて……。", "zh": "对、对啊……！可是，因为之前是在不同品牌工作，所以能见到面，真的很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "4124bb3c57e30b038a3715fa3212fa8e47e1c9c8cba410ca04ef8e4a03e234a4", "ja": "それで……思わず、言葉が……\nあ、溢れてきちゃったのかも……。", "zh": "所以……一不小心，话就……\n啊，可能就这样说出来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "8ec24c4f3ae75608f81d8c1855ce971eb51e0532347e013bf681ca151a09196e", "ja": "朋花がそこにいただけで……その背中を見ただけで、\n可憐にとっては刺激になったみたいだな。", "zh": "光是朋花在那里……光是看到她的背影，\n对可憐来说，似乎就已经是一种触动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "fe8433dcbe748b4bbfbf199dc145a1ff8e30b004bdea71d7672b0c0c2db0e9c9", "ja": "そ、そうみたいです……朋花ちゃんが、\n朋花ちゃんでいてくれて、よかったなぁ……なんて。", "zh": "好、好像是这样……幸好朋花一直是朋花……我觉得，大概就是这样吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "a8a35cc721b7a3a9ed9a0af25f5a190d86d6b4bc1c39f09b64161ecd31fc7b26", "ja": "私が……私でいたから……。", "zh": "因为我……还是我自己……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1033_031tom", "source_sha256": "2120947dd9955a90fe33ffe41becf34a62692ae87b85ef40c52316cdc0cdea33", "ja": "……ふふっ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9e62a42de7a89cfe1842211e8d9087653fb2670ce0ebe9652fa3ddd38671f9e2", "ja": "（朋花の周りの空気が変わった？　重苦しい\n気配が消えて、強めの圧が……これは……）", "zh": "（朋花周围的气氛变了？沉重的感觉消失了，取而代之的是更强的压迫感……这是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "82d11a7a87ccccea75be3cab0e8fe7be3cede68c060c35c7cc6f68edaf002a44", "ja": "可憐さんの、言うとおり……\n私は少し、悩みすぎていたかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "正如可怜所说……\n我可能确实稍微有点想太多了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1036_031tom", "source_sha256": "33de9f89b84bcfa2e485c9f02113f8720b54d63099d2497aefc8d0b0deb0c5e9", "ja": "ブランドの個性に合わせようとしすぎていて……\nでも、聖母として、それではダメだとわかりました～。", "zh": "太过拘泥于迎合品牌的个性了……\n不过，我明白了，作为圣母，这样是不行的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1037_031tom", "source_sha256": "24f288f36e04a6500ef00f31b19d80af23f6b5aae47fd463bc4afa23362c0467", "ja": "可憐さんのおかげですね～、ありがとうございます～。", "zh": "多亏了可怜呢～，非常感谢你～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "79a756296dbbdf4a830601396eea7893bf7b216604d00e501c50707730f25e0a", "ja": "ううん、私が勝手に、浮かれてただけだし……。\nでも、よかった……♪", "zh": "不，只是我自己擅自……得意忘形罢了……\n不过，太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "ea7c22644c8f44ac643dabf7fb5cb909222933973e2af2cf408c336ded56ff21", "ja": "でも、だからこそ……可憐さんの気持ちに、\nしっかりと応えてみせるのが、礼儀というもの。", "zh": "但是，正因为如此……好好回应可怜的心意，才是应有的礼数。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "b52776d57ad70c326aa3ef90c1f812f8902b88a55132df4547d479e3cc0b5dc9", "ja": "さっきの言葉に、偽りはありませんね～？\n私も……全力でいきますよ～。", "zh": "刚才的话，没有说谎吧～？\n我也……会全力以赴哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "384b05a8b0480c7698859940f11d149f1eddf5f393751d211dcbcc189bd8faa2", "ja": "う、うん……♪　よろしくね、朋花ちゃん……！", "zh": "嗯、嗯……♪　请多指教，朋花……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "ed4a17a599b19f2d75872d91f3104be67e7db136718b4c76a067be2780021fd1", "ja": "（朋花もすごいが、可憐もすごいな。\nこのプレッシャーの中で、涼しい顔をしている……）", "zh": "（朋花已经很厉害了，可怜也很厉害。在这样的压力下，她竟然还能一脸从容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "ac4e6a0f260958cfc4a88200481f5f52281a9e94d1e8b5d48cc719345dcbfa2f", "ja": "（二人とも、完全復活って感じだ。\n次の撮影、これなら心配いらないな！）", "zh": "（两个人都感觉完全恢复过来了。下一场拍摄，这样一来就不用担心了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
